                    <div class="text-xs text-cyan-950 leading-relaxed">
                        <span class="font-bold">Overall Semestral Enrollment Windows:</span> Control student access centrally at the institutional level rather than class-by-class. Configure opening and closing dates for Sem 1 and Sem 2, and enforce automated Chemistry 1 prerequisite validation for Chemistry 2.
