                                <span class="text-xs font-black text-indigo-950 block">Require passing mark in Chemistry 1 before Chemistry 2 enrollment</span>
                                <span class="text-[11px] text-indigo-700/80 leading-snug block mt-0.5">
                                    When checked, the system enforces DepEd prerequisites, preventing enrollment, section assignment, or migration into Chemistry 2 if the student has a failing or incomplete standing in Chemistry 1 (&lt; 75%).
                                </span>
                            </div>
