                    <div class="text-xs text-emerald-950 leading-relaxed">
                        <span class="font-bold">Resource Reusability &amp; Clean Cohort Slates:</span> Retain lecture materials, modules, and references without instructors having to re-upload files, while ensuring all student submissions, quiz attempts, and forum threads start clean for the incoming batch.
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="space-y-4">
                    <div>
                        <label class="block text-xs font-bold text-slate-700 mb-1.5 uppercase tracking-wider">Source Academic Year (Preceding Cohort)</label>
